    },
    {
      "description": "Forms only differ in appearance.  Furfrou’s trim can be changed at any time in Friseur Furfrou in Lumiose City.  It reverts to its Natural Form after five days unless trimmed again, or if it is deposited in the PC.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ボサボサの　たいもうを　かりこむと\nすがたが　うつくしくなる　だけでなく\nからだの　キレが　よくなるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "복슬복슬한 털을 깎고 다듬으면\n모습이 아름다워질 뿐만 아니라\n몸의 움직임도 좋아진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si son abondante fourrure gagne à être toilettée,\nce n’est pas qu’une question de style. En effet, cela\nlui permet également de se mouvoir plus librement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Schneidet man sein Fell zurecht, wird es\nnicht nur schöner, sondern auch beweglicher.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando le esquilan su mullido pelaje, no solo mejora\nsu apariencia, sino que aumenta su agilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La toelettatura del manto vaporoso non solo lo rende\npiù bello, ma gli consente anche di muoversi\npiù liberamente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trimming its fluffy fur not only makes\nit more elegant but also increases the\nswiftness of its movements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ボサボサの　体毛を　刈りこむと\n姿が　美しくなる　だけでなく\n身体の　キレが　良くなるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
